{
    "background_story": "Neo, a skilled hacker and programmer, stumbled upon an ancient text that would change his life forever. The manuscript, penned by the mysterious sorceress Circe, revealed the secrets of manipulating reality through code. Entranced by the possibilities, Neo devoted himself to mastering the arcane language. As he delved deeper into the mysteries of Circe's magic, he discovered he had a natural affinity for it. Neo's newfound powers allowed him to bend the digital world to his will, creating mesmerizing illusions and altering the fabric of reality. His abilities soon caught the attention of a secret society, who sought to exploit his talents for their own gain. Neo must now navigate the blurred lines between the physical and digital worlds, all while confronting the dark forces that seek to control him.",
